  ob name text radio song name raw to name radio song name answer be plus do
  ob text "\n\nTHE SHEET:\n" to name radio song name answer be plus do
  ob name text radio song name sheet to name radio song name answer be plus do

  ob text "node world/house/radio/command/extract_song_name.mjs" fromtext name radio song name answer to name text song name out be command do

  su name song name out ret
